    "description": "<p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Hazards\" title=\"Hazards\">Hazards</a></i> </p><p>The below Hazards include all Hazards part of the Ambient, Atmospheric, and Climatic environments: </p><table class=\"sortable wikitable\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <th>NAME </th> \n   <th>CHALLENGE LEVEL </th> \n   <th>KEYWORDS </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <th colspan=\"3\">Saga Edition Core Rulebook </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Radiation\" title=\"Radiation\">Radiation</a>, Mild </td> \n   <td>CL 2 </td> \n   <td>Atmosphere, Disease </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Smoke\" title=\"Smoke\">Smoke</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 2 </td> \n   <td>Atmosphere, Natural </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\">Fire</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 3 </td> \n   <td>Artificial or Natural, Fire </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Corrosive_Atmosphere\" title=\"Corrosive Atmosphere\">Corrosive Atmosphere</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 4 </td> \n   <td>Acid, Atmosphere, Contact, Natural </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Extreme_Heat_or_Cold\" title=\"Extreme Heat or Cold\">Extreme Heat or Cold</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 4 </td> \n   <td>Natural </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Radiation\" title=\"Radiation\">Radiation</a>, Moderate </td> \n   <td>CL 4 </td> \n   <td>Atmosphere, Disease </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Toxic_Atmosphere\" title=\"Toxic Atmosphere\">Toxic Atmosphere</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 6 </td> \n   <td>Atmosphere, Contact, Natural </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Radiation\" title=\"Radiation\">Radiation</a>, Severe </td> \n   <td>CL 7 </td> \n   <td>Atmosphere, Disease </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vacuum\" title=\"Vacuum\">Vacuum</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 8 </td> \n   <td>Atmosphere, Contact, Natural </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Radiation\" title=\"Radiation\">Radiation</a>, Extreme </td> \n   <td>CL 10 </td> \n   <td>Atmosphere, Disease </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <th colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Unknown_Regions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Unknown Regions\">Unknown Regions</a> </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Freezing_Rain\" title=\"Freezing Rain\">Freezing Rain</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 4 </td> \n   <td>Atmosphere, Natural </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Sandstorm\" title=\"Sandstorm\">Sandstorm</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 4 </td> \n   <td>Area, Atmosphere, Natural </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Floating_Away\" title=\"Floating Away\">Floating Away</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 5 </td> \n   <td>Natural </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Acidic_Storm\" title=\"Acidic Storm\">Acidic Storm</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 9 </td> \n   <td>Atmosphere, Energy, Natural </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Heavy_Fog\" title=\"Heavy Fog\">Heavy Fog</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 12 </td> \n   <td>Atmosphere, Natural </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Building_Decompression\" title=\"Building Decompression\">Building Decompression</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 14 </td> \n   <td>Natural </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table>",
